  "stageId": "main_01-06",
  "title": "Catastrophe",
  "storyCode": "1-6",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b32ede69f5e1af51bd8274994aeb85e5c4a5d88e975e6ab9869922ac82158bef",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第九关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Indeed. They don't know that Faust is following them. I received some information from one of his scouts.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Rhodes Island is trapped around the perimeter of the city center.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Insects as they might be, they still might take advantage of the confusion caused by the Catastrophe to make their escape.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Given their understanding of the situation in Chernobog, they could potentially interfere with our plans.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "... At least, getting rid of them won't do us any harm.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Chernobog bastards! It's because of you, it's all your fault... that us Infected became like this!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Get lost!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Ugh!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "These people, it's like they're just waiting to die! !",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "Why is Reunion going completely berserk?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Why are they sending so many members out here now?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "This makes no sense! There's no reason for them to be defending this place so staunchly!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "Rhodes Island Operators, stand your ground! Push Reunion back and open up an escape route!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "So that's the 'Rhodes Island' that I've been hearing so much about? Heh... How heroic.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "...Huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "... Falling rocks? At a time like this?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Don't stop moving! Maintain our defensive line!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Something's not right... These rocks are coming from the buildings...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "What are you talking about...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "It's here! It's here!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Ahaha... salvation has come for us! Judgment day has come!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Ahhh, arghhhh--*CRASH!*",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Ahhh, arghhhh--*CRASH!*",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "They were... crushed by something?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Was it one of you... who attacked them?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Or were they...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Dobermann! Look, the sky...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "The sky was dyed a bloody crimson...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "'Boiling dark clouds, tumbling in flames...'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "Don't panic!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "Keep your senses about you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "... We still can make it out of this alive if we act decisively!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "'...As terror strips away their voices, the land falls into silence.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "'The titanic Originium lowers its head...'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "'...and falls upon the scorched shadow of death.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "text": "Talulah.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "text": "What do we do next?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "... Perhaps they will be able to survive the Catastrophe.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "text": "Finish off the stragglers.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "text": "Very well.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Even though I figured that Reunion would be using the Catastrophe to take their revenge...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "I didn't expect them to use it to completely destroy Chernobog...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Rather than vengeance, this seems more like a manifesto...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Something about the Era of the Infected... or something like that?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "Aaaahh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "The entire sky... is crashing down...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Watch out! !",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "What's that...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Be more alert!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "-- Oh!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Protect the Medic - hurry and take her someplace safe!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Roger!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "All operators, find cover!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "All teams, prepare to... weather the Catastrophe!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
